      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, the ones dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems are Arcadia Cloudworks, BlueHarbor Logistics, CedarWind Renewables, HelioFab Systems, Pacific Health Network, and Pioneer Freight Solutions. These customers report issues such as search relevance degradation, low-relevance or missing results, misfiring runbook triggers, and schema or index mapping problems following taxonomy updates.\n\nThe accounts dealing with duplicate-action problems related to workflow deduplication drift during cross-system handoffs and post-acquisition systems consolidation are Helix Assemblies Inc., LedgerBright Analytics, LedgerPeak Software, MedLogix Distribution, Peregrine Logistics Group, and Pioneer Grid Retail LLC. These customers report duplicate incidents, repeated remediation runs, idempotency key mismatches, and paging storms after acquisition integrations or system consolidations.\n\nThis classification is based on the specific pain points and symptoms reported in support tickets for each account. There is no explicit evidence that any account is exclusively in one category or the other, but the evidence distinctly groups these accounts by the described problem types [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb].",
